Brand voice principles
title end

paragraph start
The voice is one consistent character across every post, and only the tone changes with the situation. Define it with three to five traits, and give each trait one do example and one do not example.
paragraph end

paragraph start
A trait is useful only when its opposite is a real choice. Calm is a usable trait. Good is not, because nobody chooses bad.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
trait, meaning in one sentence, do example, do not example
code end

paragraph start
todo: choose the traits and write the examples
Open until the owner decides.
